mensions, but it should be doable to look into. (Not sure why these compiles took so long, I don't remember this much of an issue on my last bisect, will need to look into it)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3046082270/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3046450519","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108330#issuecomment-3046450519","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108330","id":3046450519,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc61lSVX","user":{"login":"CreatedBySeb","id":11736217,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzM2MjE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11736217?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb","html_url":"https://github.com/CreatedBySeb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-07T20:36:51Z","updated_at":"2025-07-07T20:45:53Z","body":"Localised the issue to these sections:\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/4d1f26e1fd1fa46f2223fe0b6ac300744bf79b88/editor/script/find_in_files.cpp#L788\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/4d1f26e1fd1fa46f2223fe0b6ac300744bf79b88/editor/script/find_in_files.cpp#L858-L873\n\nSince column 0 is set to not expand (presumably because of the checkboxes), it seems to cause this issue with the button being out of bounds. If I shift `int text_index = _with_replace ? 1 : 0;` up before the if statement and use it in place of `0` to have the text + button in column 1, then it fixes the issue. This isn't an ideal solution though as it makes it look different to the Find pane, so I'll figure something else out.\n\nAlso - I am not sure what is the purpose of the checkboxes when the X buttons serve a similar purpose? I'm not quite sure I understand the benefit of them","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3046450519/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]